      "blockers": [
        "static Oracle text is not compiled into one generic continuous, prevention, and replacement effect model",
        "appropriate-zone evaluation is distributed across exact handlers and narrow grammars",
        "no replay case covers a generic static prevention or replacement source entering and leaving its applicable zone"
      ],
      "notes": [
        "Padeem's represented battlefield effect appears and disappears with the source, but that partial witness does not establish every static effect family."
      ]
    },
