      "blockers": [
        "the Oracle IR does not generically identify characteristic-defining abilities and their defined characteristics",
        "dynamic characteristic handlers commonly evaluate only on the battlefield rather than in every zone, outside the game, and before the game",
        "CDA additions and overrides do not share one all-zone layer query"
      ],
      "notes": [
        "Printed and copied characteristics are represented, but that is not evidence for characteristic-defining ability scope."
      ]
    },
